{"id":"e87d656c032390a9","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-computable-approximation.md","title":"可计算逼近","display":"df-computable-approximation — 可计算逼近","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-computable-approximation","aliases":["43-df-computable-approximation"],"display":"df-computable-approximation — 可计算逼近","depends_on":["[[43-df-computable]]","[[43-df-infseq]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"§5.2 and Lemma 5.6.1, print pp.11,18 / PDF pp.31,38","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"definition-reviewed","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-computable-approximation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-computable-approximation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-computable-approximation — 可计算逼近"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"565c3258eee2a5ff\" href=\"?note=565c3258eee2a5ff\" title=\"43-df-infseq\">43-df-infseq</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§5.2 and Lemma 5.6.1, print pp.11,18 / PDF pp.31,38"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-reviewed"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(g:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> 全定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Approx}(g,A)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Computable}(g)\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists s_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall s\\in\\mathbb N\\;(s\\ge s_0\\Rightarrow g(x,s)=\\chi_A(x)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Approx}(g,A)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Computable}(g)\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists s_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall s\\in\\mathbb N\\;(s\\ge s_0\\Rightarrow g(x,s)=\\chi_A(x)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>每个输入最终稳定，但不要求存在可计算的稳定阶段函数；若误加有效收敛模，便只剩可计算集。</p>\n<p>来源：§5.2 and Lemma 5.6.1, print pp.11,18 / PDF pp.31,38。版本为用户提供的 2007-07-28 草稿。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-infseq","status":"resolved","id":"565c3258eee2a5ff","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-infseq]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"g:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Approx}(g,A)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Computable}(g)\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists s_0\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall s\\in\\mathbb N\\;(s\\ge s_0\\Rightarrow g(x,s)=\\chi_A(x)).","display":true}],"bytes":1091,"backlinks":[{"id":"ad966749904b15ec","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$c:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\mathbb Q_{\\ge0}$；$\\mathrm{CostFunction}$ 见 [[43-df-cost-function]]；$a:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\{0,1\\}$ 是下式量化的全函数；$\\operatorname{Approx}(a,A)$ 采用 [[43-df-computable-approximation]] 中可计算且逐输入最终稳定于 $A$ 的正式定义。下式为每个 $a$ 构造仅在变化阶段定义的 $m_a$；费用级数在 $[0,+\\infty]$ 中取非负级数和。"},{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-computable-approximation]] — 可计算逼近"},{"id":"f84d91e84ff5873a","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"本原子所用非基础符号采用本目录的形式定义：[[43-df-wtt]]、[[43-df-jump]]、[[43-df-computable-approximation]]、[[43-df-computable]]。"},{"id":"1739c5244c36a9d3","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"本原子所用非基础符号采用本目录的形式定义：[[43-df-ce]]、[[43-df-computable-approximation]]。"}],"outgoing":["f357216a7edb035a","565c3258eee2a5ff"]}